292		/**
293		 * Return a {@link StandardStackTracePrinter} that prints the stack trace with the
294		 * root exception last (the same as {@link Throwable#printStackTrace()}).
295		 * @return a {@link StandardStackTracePrinter} that prints the stack trace root last
296		 */
